A '''Baker''' (Japanese: '''ベーカリー''' ''Bakery'') is a type of {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}} introduced in [[Generation V]]. They are women with a chef's hat, tray, and apron. Bakers are sometimes seen living in pink trailers with all their cooking utensils and cooking appliances enclosed within. Some Bakers ask players for ingredients or assistance. They use a variety of different {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}, mainly ones that are related to food or food preparation. In the [[Battle Subway]], some Bakers specialize in {{t|Grass}}- and {{type|Fire}} Pokémon benefiting from [[harsh sunlight]].

